##### R2.expression_eval
== 146 R2.expression_eval L0 i1
Work out <text> by this rule, which is not the usual one: work out each pair of parentheses first, innermost first, and inside a pair of parentheses use the same rule as outside; the rule is that the operators are done strictly in the order they are written, from left to right, and multiplication gets no priority over addition or subtraction (so # + # * # is worked as (# + #) * # = #). What is the result?
== 134 R2.expression_eval L0 i0
